  "body": "Found while reviewing #44. Two commits.\n\n## 1. The merge barrier that #43 removed\n\n#43 took the completion gate off the PR view so `validate` could pass on a pre-approval head \u2014 necessary, because an auditor that refuses red heads can never produce the approval that turns them green. But that gate was also the only thing stopping a `ready_for_audit` packet from being merged.\n\nVerified against #44 as it stands today: its `validate` is green, and merging it turns protected `main` red after the fact. With auto-merge enabled repo-wide, a scout packet could merge itself unaudited.\n\nOne status check cannot answer both questions, so there are now two:\n\n| check | question | on a `ready_for_audit` head |\n|---|---|---|\n| `validate` | is this packet well-formed enough to audit? | green \u2014 audit proceeds |\n| `intake-complete` | may this head reach `main`? | red \u2014 merge blocked |\n\nApproval + promotion turn the second one green, and the merge proceeds normally. Verified on the real #44 branch:\n\n- `validate` under `--synthetic-merge`: clean\n- `intake-complete` (`--synthetic-merge --completion-only`): refuses the unpromoted packet\n\n**This needs one action I can't take:** add `intake-complete` to the protected-branch required checks (Settings \u2192 Branches \u2192 `main`). Until then it reports but does not block.\n\n## 2. Operator profile copies removed\n\nThe Hermes profiles now carry this wording upstream, so in-repo copies would drift silently against the live personas.\n\nRemoving them also takes persona prose back out of the KB search surface \u2014 `kb-mcp-server.mjs` walks all of `BoardGames/` and matches plain `.md`, so those files answered corpus queries and rode the Axiomancer `kb/` sync.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `node --test` intake suite: 46 pass, 0 fail, 1 intentional skip\n- `node scripts/validate-okf.mjs`: 2637 files clean + INDEX fresh\n- `node scripts/validate-intake.mjs --base origin/main`: clean\n- `node scripts/validate-intake.mjs --base origin/main --completion-only`: clean\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01NVc2uM86fGHcqYNChtCFtK)_",
